---
// Tactical Advantage / 5 Benefits section matching screenshot
---

<section class="bg-[#070E17] py-20 text-white border-b border-[#1A2638]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:cp8evn">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi38">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2m">
      
      <!-- Left Column: 5 Benefits list -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2l">
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2k">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-[#DBA400] rotate-45 inline-block" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke8"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke7">
            TACTICAL ADVANTAGE
          </span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] leading-[1.15] mb-10 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[40px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:34j6nz">
          5 Benefits of Hiring a Security Company
        </h2>

        <!-- Benefit items -->
        <div class="space-y-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2j">
          
          <!-- Benefit 01 -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2i">
            <span class="text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-sm mt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke6">
              01
            </span>
            <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2h">
              <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1.5 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[20px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vp">
                Sense of Security
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-['Manrope']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp6">
                Even just the presence of a security guard can make a business more effective and efficient by giving the owners and employees peace of mind.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefit 02 -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2g">
            <span class="text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-sm mt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke5">
              02
            </span>
            <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2f">
              <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1.5 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[20px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vo">
                Prevention
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-['Manrope']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp5">
                A thief will think twice when there is a security guard present. It lets them know that you are serious about the security of your business and will deter them from targeting you.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefit 03 -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2e">
            <span class="text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-sm mt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke4">
              03
            </span>
            <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:7ifi2d">
              <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1.5 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[20px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vn">
                Customer Service
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-['Manrope']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp4">
                Not only does a sense of security put your employees at ease but also your customers.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefit 04 -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cz">
            <span class="text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-sm mt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke3">
              04
            </span>
            <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cy">
              <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1.5 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[20px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vm">
                Handling Crime
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-['Manrope']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp3">
                Having a security guard will deter crime in your business but it may still happen; having security measures in place will allow police to solve a crime quickly and get you back to business in no time!
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Benefit 05 -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cx">
            <span class="text-[#DBA400] font-['Space_Grotesk'] font-bold text-sm mt-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hke2">
              05
            </span>
            <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cw">
              <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1.5 text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[20px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vl">
                Monitoring
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed font-['Manrope']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp2">
                Take this responsibility off of your shoulders and leave your business security to a professional security guard company.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Guard Photo with Field Operations badge & 24/7 / 100% metrics -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cv">
        
        <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#1E2D42] shadow-2xl mb-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cu">
          <img
            src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/fe6bcc20/images/The-Buck-photo-320-db0401-320.webp"
            alt="Professional Security Guard"
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[520px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:a0omeq" />
          <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#070E17] via-[#070E17]/80 to-transparent p-6 pt-12" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5ct">
            <p class="text-[#DBA400] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest font-['Space_Grotesk'] mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:p3vnp1">
              FIELD OPERATIONS
            </p>
            <h3 class="font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-[rgb(250,250,250)] text-[26px]" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:hsy3vk">
              Protection Excellence
            </h3>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metrics Row below image -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-[#1E2D42] pt-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cs">
          <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cr">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-white block mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hkdg">
              24/7
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 font-['Space_Grotesk']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hkdf">
              READINESS
            </span>
          </div>

          <div data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:4tp5cq">
            <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-white block mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hkde">
              100%
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 font-['Space_Grotesk']" data-ps="src/components/home/Benefits.astro:y5hkdd">
              COMPLIANCE
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
